working with us. This page sets out the agreement between Aakash AP Ltd and our clients and website visitors."}]]}],null]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"w-full py-space-3xl bg-surface","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin lg:px-margin-desktop grid grid-cols-1 xl:grid-cols-[300px_1fr] gap-space-2xl","children":[["$","aside",null,{"className":"hidden xl:block","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"sticky top-28 space-y-space-lg","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase text-forest-deep tracking-wider","children":"On this page"}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"Terms of Service sections","children":["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-1.5 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-muted","children":[["$","li","Scope of Services",{"children":["$","a",null,{"className":"block hover:text-forest-deep transition-colors leading-snug","href":"#scope-of-services","children":"Scope of Services"}]}],["$","li","Engagement & Fees",{"children":["$","a",null,{"className":"block hover:text-forest-deep transition-colors leading-snug","href":"#engagement-fees","children":"Engagement & Fees"}]}],["$","li","Client Responsibilities",{"children":["$","a",null,{"className":"block hover:text-forest-deep transition-colors leading-snug","href":"#client-responsibilities","children":"Client Responsibilities"}]}],["$","li","Service Levels & Governance",{"children":["$","a",null,{"className":"block hover:text-forest-deep transition-colors leading-snug","href":"#service-levels-governance","children":"Service Levels & Governance"}]}],["$","li","Confidentiality",{"children":["$","a",null,{"className":"block hover:text-forest-deep transition-colors leading-snug","href":"#confidentiality","children":"Confidentiality"}]}],["$","li","Intellectual Property",{"children":["$","a",null,{"className":"block hover:text-forest-deep transition-colors leading-snug","href":"#intellectual-property","children":"Intellectual Property"}]}],["$","li","Data Protection",{"children":["$","a",null,{"className":"block hover:text-forest-deep transition-colors leading-snug","href":"#data-protection","children":"Data Protection"}]}],["$","li","Limitation of Liability",{"children":["$","a",null,{"className":"block hover:text-forest-deep transition-colors leading-snug","href":"#limitation-of-liability","children":"Limitation of Liability"}]}],["$","li","Term & Termination",{"children":["$","a",null,{"className":"block hover:text-forest-deep transition-colors leading-snug","href":"#term-termination","children":"Term & Termination"}]}],["$","li","Governing Law",{"children":["$","a",null,{"className":"block hover:text-forest-deep transition-colors leading-snug","href":"#governing-law","children":"Governing Law"}]}],["$","li","Changes to These Terms",{"children":["$","a",null,{"className":"block hover:text-forest-deep transition-colors leading-snug","href":"#changes-to-these-terms","children":"Changes to These Terms"}]}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-space-xs text-label-sm font-label-sm text-slate-text-muted border-t border-slate-border pt-space-md","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-forest-mid","children":"update"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Last updated ","1 September 2025"]}]]}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-3xl space-y-space-2xl","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-body-lg text-body-lg text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"These Terms of Service govern the provision of recruitment process outsourcing, business process outsourcing, and related services by Aakash AP Ltd to its clients. By engaging our services or using this website, you agree to these terms unless a separate written agreement states otherwise. If you have questions, contact advisory@aakashap.com."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-space-xs text-label-sm font-label-sm text-slate-text-muted xl:hidden","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-forest-mid","children":"update"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Last updated ","1 September 2025"]}]]}],[["$","section","Scope of Services",{"className":"space-y-space-md scroll-mt-28","id":"scope-of-services","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"Scope of Services"}],[["$","p","Aakash AP Ltd provides offshore recruitment process outsourcing and business process outsourcing services, which may include full cycle recruitment, candidate sourcing and screening, market intelligence, back office and administrative support, finance and accounting support, virtual staffing, and digital marketing services.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Aakash AP Ltd provides offshore recruitment process outsourcing and business process outsourcing services, which may include full cycle recruitment, candidate sourcing and screening, market intelligence, back office and administrative support, finance and accounting support, virtual staffing, and digital marketing services."}],["$","p","The specific services, deliverables, and performance expectations for each engagement are set out in a written statement of work, order form, or master services agreement signed by both parties. In the event of conflict, the order of precedence is the signed statement of work, then the master services agreement, then these terms.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"The specific services, deliverables, and performance expectations for each engagement are set out in a written statement of work, order form, or master services agreement signed by both parties. In the event of conflict, the order of precedence is the signed statement of work, then the master services agreement, then these terms."}]],null]}],["$","section","Engagement & Fees",{"className":"space-y-space-md scroll-mt-28","id":"engagement-fees","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"Engagement & Fees"}],[["$","p","Fees are agreed in the applicable statement of work and may be structured as monthly retainers, per-seat charges, per-hire fees, or milestone-based payments. Unless stated otherwise, invoices are issued monthly and are payable within thirty days of the invoice date, in the currency specified in the statement of work.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Fees are agreed in the applicable statement of work and may be structured as monthly retainers, per-seat charges, per-hire fees, or milestone-based payments. Unless stated otherwise, invoices are issued monthly and are payable within thirty days of the invoice date, in the currency specified in the statement of work."}],["$","p","Fees are exclusive of applicable taxes, duties, and pre-approved expenses, which will be charged at cost with reasonable supporting documentation. We may review and adjust rates on written notice in accordance with the review provisions of the relevant statement of work.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Fees are exclusive of applicable taxes, duties, and pre-approved expenses, which will be charged at cost with reasonable supporting documentation. We may review and adjust rates on written notice in accordance with the review provisions of the relevant statement of work."}]],null]}],["$","section","Client Responsibilities",{"className":"space-y-space-md scroll-mt-28","id":"client-responsibilities","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"Client Responsibilities"}],[["$","p","The client agrees to provide accurate and complete information about its business, requirements, and processes, and to deliver timely feedback, approvals, and access needed for delivery. The client will designate an authorised point of contact empowered to make decisions relating to the engagement.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"The client agrees to provide accurate and complete information about its business, requirements, and processes, and to deliver timely feedback, approvals, and access needed for delivery. The client will designate an authorised point of contact empowered to make decisions relating to the engagement."}],["$","p","The client is responsible for ensuring that its instructions, materials, and data are lawful, that it holds all necessary rights and consents, and that any use of our services complies with applicable employment, recruitment, and data protection laws in its jurisdiction.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"The client is responsible for ensuring that its instructions, materials, and data are lawful, that it holds all necessary rights and consents, and that any use of our services complies with applicable employment, recruitment, and data protection laws in its jurisdiction."}]],null]}],["$","section","Service Levels & Governance",{"className":"space-y-space-md scroll-mt-28","id":"service-levels-governance","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"Service Levels & Governance"}],[["$","p","Where service level agreements are agreed, they are documented in the statement of work and measured monthly against defined metrics such as response times, submission quality, and delivery volumes. Service credits, where applicable, are the client's sole financial remedy for missed service levels.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Where service level agreements are agreed, they are documented in the statement of work and measured monthly against defined metrics such as response times, submission quality, and delivery volumes. Service credits, where applicable, are the client's sole financial remedy for missed service levels."}],["$","p","Each engagement operates under a governance rhythm agreed at mobilisation, typically including weekly operational reviews and quarterly strategic reviews. Escalation paths and reporting formats are documented in the engagement handbook provided at kick-off.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Each engagement operates under a governance rhythm agreed at mobilisation, typically including weekly operational reviews and quarterly strategic reviews. Escalation paths and reporting formats are documented in the engagement handbook provided at kick-off."}]],null]}],["$","section","Confidentiality",{"className":"space-y-space-md scroll-mt-28","id":"confidentiality","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"Confidentiality"}],[["$","p","Each party may receive confidential information belonging to the other, including business plans, pricing, candidate data, and client lists. Both parties agree to use such information solely for the purposes of the engagement and to protect it with at least the same degree of care used for their own confidential information, and no less than a reasonable standard of care.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Each party may receive confidential information belonging to the other, including business plans, pricing, candidate data, and client lists. Both parties agree to use such information solely for the purposes of the engagement and to protect it with at least the same degree of care used for their own confidential information, and no less than a reasonable standard of care."}],["$","p","These obligations do not apply to information that is or becomes public through no breach of these terms, was lawfully known before disclosure, or must be disclosed by law or court order. On termination, each party will return or securely destroy the other's confidential information on written request.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"These obligations do not apply to information that is or becomes public through no breach of these terms, was lawfully known before disclosure, or must be disclosed by law or court order. On termination, each party will return or securely destroy the other's confidential information on written request."}]],null]}],["$","section","Intellectual Property",{"className":"space-y-space-md scroll-mt-28","id":"intellectual-property","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"Intellectual Property"}],[["$","p","Aakash AP Ltd retains all rights in its methodologies, frameworks, tools, templates, training materials, and know-how, including any improvements made during an engagement. The client retains all rights in its own materials, data, and systems made available to us.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Aakash AP Ltd retains all rights in its methodologies, frameworks, tools, templates, training materials, and know-how, including any improvements made during an engagement. The client retains all rights in its own materials, data, and systems made available to us."}],["$","p","Deliverables created specifically for the client under a statement of work are assigned to the client upon full payment of the associated fees, excluding our pre-existing and generally applicable materials, which remain our property and are licensed to the client for internal use.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Deliverables created specifically for the client under a statement of work are assigned to the client upon full payment of the associated fees, excluding our pre-existing and generally applicable materials, which remain our property and are licensed to the client for internal use."}]],null]}],["$","section","Data Protection",{"className":"space-y-space-md scroll-mt-28","id":"data-protection","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"Data Protection"}],[["$","p","Where we process personal data on behalf of the client, we do so as a data processor and the client acts as controller. The parties will enter into a data processing agreement that sets out the subject matter, duration, nature, and purpose of processing, and the obligations of each party under applicable data protection law.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Where we process personal data on behalf of the client, we do so as a data processor and the client acts as controller. The parties will enter into a data processing agreement that sets out the subject matter, duration, nature, and purpose of processing, and the obligations of each party under applicable data protection law."}],["$","p","We maintain ISO 27001-aligned security controls, use vetted sub-processors, and notify clients without undue delay, and in any event within twenty-four hours, of becoming aware of a confirmed personal data breach affecting their data. International transfers are governed by the safeguards described in our Privacy Policy.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"We maintain ISO 27001-aligned security controls, use vetted sub-processors, and notify clients without undue delay, and in any event within twenty-four hours, of becoming aware of a confirmed personal data breach affecting their data. International transfers are governed by the safeguards described in our Privacy Policy."}]],null]}],["$","section","Limitation of Liability",{"className":"space-y-space-md scroll-mt-28","id":"limitation-of-liability","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"Limitation of Liability"}],[["$","p","Nothing in these terms excludes or limits liability for death or personal injury caused by negligence, fraud or fraudulent misrepresentation, or any other liability that cannot lawfully be excluded. Subject to that, neither party is liable for indirect, consequential, or incidental losses, loss of profit, loss of business, or loss of anticipated savings.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Nothing in these terms excludes or limits liability for death or personal injury caused by negligence, fraud or fraudulent misrepresentation, or any other liability that cannot lawfully be excluded. Subject to that, neither party is liable for indirect, consequential, or incidental losses, loss of profit, loss of business, or loss of anticipated savings."}],["$","p","Subject to the paragraph above, each party's total aggregate liability arising out of or in connection with an engagement is limited to the total fees paid or payable by the client under the relevant statement of work in the twelve months immediately preceding the event giving rise to the claim.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Subject to the paragraph above, each party's total aggregate liability arising out of or in connection with an engagement is limited to the total fees paid or payable by the client under the relevant statement of work in the twelve months immediately preceding the event giving rise to the claim."}]],null]}],["$","section","Term & Termination",{"className":"space-y-space-md scroll-mt-28","id":"term-termination","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"Term & Termination"}],[["$","p","Each engagement begins on the effective date stated in the statement of work and continues for the initial term specified there, after which it renews for successive periods unless either party gives written notice of non-renewal at least sixty days before the end of the then-current term.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Each engagement begins on the effective date stated in the statement of work and continues for the initial term specified there, after which it renews for successive periods unless either party gives written notice of non-renewal at least sixty days before the end of the then-current term."}],["$","p","Either party may terminate an engagement immediately for material breach that remains uncured thirty days after written notice, or on insolvency of the other party. On termination, the client will pay for services delivered and commitments properly incurred up to the effective date of termination, and each party will return or destroy confidential information as set out above.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Either party may terminate an engagement immediately for material breach that remains uncured thirty days after written notice, or on insolvency of the other party. On termination, the client will pay for services delivered and commitments properly incurred up to the effective date of termination, and each party will return or destroy confidential information as set out above."}]],null]}],["$","section","Governing Law",{"className":"space-y-space-md scroll-mt-28","id":"governing-law","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"Governing Law"}],[["$","p","These terms and any dispute or claim arising out of or in connection with them are governed by the laws of England and Wales. The parties submit to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of England and Wales, unless the applicable statement of work specifies a different dispute resolution procedure such as mediation or arbitration.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"These terms and any dispute or claim arising out of or in connection with them are governed by the laws of England and Wales. The parties submit to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of England and Wales, unless the applicable statement of work specifies a different dispute resolution procedure such as mediation or arbitration."}],["$","p","Before commencing proceedings, the parties agree to attempt in good faith to resolve any dispute through escalation to senior representatives for a period of thirty days following written notice of the dispute.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Before commencing proceedings, the parties agree to attempt in good faith to resolve any dispute through escalation to senior representatives for a period of thirty days following written notice of the dispute."}]],null]}],["$","section","Changes to These Terms",{"className":"space-y-space-md scroll-mt-28","id":"changes-to-these-terms","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"Changes to These Terms"}],[["$","p","We may update these terms from time to time to reflect changes in our services, legal requirements, or business practices. The current version is always available on this page and is dated at the top.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"We may update these terms from time to time to reflect changes in our services, legal requirements, or business practices. The current version is always available on this page and is dated at the top."}],["$","p","Material changes will apply to new engagements from the date of pub